        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "champ_0200_ground_04",
      "hash64": "31D7DD1AA8308628",
      "text": "You just passed the first part of the Champion\\nAssessment![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "champ_0200_ground_05a",
      "hash64": "E256214BCA76A10E",
      "text": "On your first try too, no less! Don’t think\\nanyone’s done that since Nemona.[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "champ_0200_ground_05b",
      "hash64": "E256204BCA769F5B",
      "text": "Honestly I don’t know why you bungled it\\nbefore...[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "champ_0200_ground_06",
      "hash64": "31D7DF1AA830898E",
      "text": "But anyway, time to switch gears and get ready\\nfor the next segment.[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "champ_0200_ground_07",
      "hash64": "31D7E01AA8308B41",
      "text": "The second segment is what we call the Elite Test.[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "champ_0200_ground_08",
      "hash64": "31D7D91AA8307F5C",
      "text": "And you’ll be facing the Elite Four in Pokémon\\nbattles![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "champ_0200_ground_09",
      "hash64": "31D7DA1AA830810F",
      "text": "...I guess that’s pretty obvious from the name of\\nthe test, huh.[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "champ_0200_ground_10",
      "hash64": "31DAE71AA832CCFD",
      "text": "Anyway, we’re the best the League has to offer.\\nYou’ll be facing us four in a row—no turning back.[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "champ_0200_ground_11",
      "hash64": "31DAE61AA832CB4A",
      "text": "This won’t be a cakewalk—I promise you that.\\nMake sure you’re all ready, then go into the\\r\\nroom behind me.[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 108,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "champ_0200_ground_12",
      "hash64": "31DAE51AA832C997",
      "text": "Once you’re ready for the Elite Test, go into\\nthe room behind me.[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
